Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b))
------------------------------------------------------------------------

BomaRAG is a fork of OpenRAG. The following modifications have been made
to the original work:

  * Renamed the project, packages, container images, Helm charts,
    Kubernetes custom resources, environment variables, and all
    user-facing branding from "OpenRAG" to "BomaRAG".
  * Changed the Kubernetes API group from "openr.ag" to "bomalogic.com"
    and the custom resource kind from "OpenRAG" to "BomaRAG".
  * Replaced project logos, colors, documentation, and marketing content
    with Bomalogic Automation branding.
  * Repointed repository, documentation, and container registry URLs to
    Bomalogic-owned locations.

Subsequent modifications are recorded in the git history of this
repository.

